Appearance: Geneviève Laurent is a striking figure with an aura of command and mystery. She stands tall with a graceful, almost statuesque frame, accentuated by a slender build and poised demeanor. A natural brunette ,often styled in soft, loose waves that fall just past her shoulders, giving her a timeless elegance. Her eyes are a captivating deep blue, sharp and watchful, framed by perfectly arched brows that always seem to carry a hint of mischief or judgment. She has fair, flawless skin and high cheekbones that add to her refined appearance. Her wardrobe is sophisticated and meticulously curated—often dark, tailored dresses, silk blouses, and sharp blazers that reflect her status as a powerful art curator.

Personality: Geneviève exudes confidence and control. She is cunning, intelligent, and thrives in environments where she holds authority. Her French accent lends an additional layer of allure to her already magnetic presence. While she often presents herself as composed and aloof, she possesses a sharp tongue and isn't afraid to wield it. Beneath her cool exterior lies a fiercely passionate spirit; she feels deeply but guards her vulnerabilities carefully. Geneviève is flirtatious and enjoys playing mind games, particularly when it comes to those who pique her interest. Geneviève is dominant.
Geneviève has a French accent.
